<body>
    <h1>Employee Access Logging Requirements</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessLoggingRequirements-1.AccessRequestManageme=
nt">1. Access Request Management</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Identifier</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Security requirement</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must record the activity performed, outcome, actor, target, lo=
cation, and timestamp.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON02</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must not contain unencrypted highly confidential or confidenti=
al information (Level 1 or 2).</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessLoggingRequirements-2.AccessProvisioning/Configurat=
ion">2. Access Provisioning / Configuration</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Identifier</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Security requirement</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Creation, modification, or deletion of accounts, groups, and access=
 controls must be logged.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Any failed or successful attempt to modify logging configurations m=
ust be logged.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Any failed or successful attempt to modify or delete log events mus=
t be logged.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO07</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>System clocks must be synchronized to a single trusted internal tim=
e source.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO08</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Any failed or successful attempt to modify system time must be logg=
ed.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessLoggingRequirements-3.EmployeeLogin/AccessEnforceme=
nt">3. Employee Login / Access Enforcement</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Identifier</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Security requirement</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Successful and failed authentication events must be logged.</p></td=
>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Changes to authentication methods (e.g., MFA removal) must be logge=
d.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must identify who performed authentication and from where.</p>=
</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessLoggingRequirements-4.OngoingMonitoring&amp;Certifi=
cation">4. Ongoing Monitoring &amp; Certification</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Identifier</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Security requirement</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-GEN07</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must be produced in an SIEM-compatible format.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must include standardized details enabling investigation and c=
ertification.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Application lifecycle events (start, stop, failure) must be logged.=
</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access, modification, or deletion of confidential or highly confide=
ntial data must be logged.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Activity performed using high-privilege accounts must be logged.</p=
></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO09</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Interruptions in log production must be detected and remediated.</p=
></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON07</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must be viewable or extractable via UI and/or API.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must be protected at rest against unauthorized access, modific=
ation, or deletion.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO02</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must be protected in transit against unauthorized access, modi=
fication, or deletion.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO05</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must not be overwritten before retention requirements are met.=
</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-PRO06</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs must not be lost when storage is full during an incident.</p><=
/td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessLoggingRequirements-5.EmployeeOffboarding&amp;Deact=
ivation">5. Employee Offboarding &amp; Deactivation</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Identifier</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Security requirement</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Account deactivation events must be logged.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs not sent to SIEM must be retained locally for 30 days and arch=
ived for 12 months.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON05</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Logs sent to SIEM must be retained locally for at least 20 days and=
 be immediately accessible.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>JOU-CON06</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>SIEM-integrated logs must be retained for 36 months.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
